Usage: cicada <command> [arguments]

Create a project, edit and validate scores, play them in Studio, or render files.

Commands:
  new, fix, check, fmt, play, studio, lsp
  render, stems, verify-wav, verify-stems, midi, verify-midi, compare-midi
  gen, explain, view, highlight, symbols, convert, compare, validate, ast
  events, graph, fields, params, golden

Run "cicada help <command>" for usage and flags.
